
  Pollinations sandbox: your Linux computer in the cloud.

  Try:  claude        Claude Code
        opencode      OpenCode
        polli --help  images, text, audio and video from the terminal
        herdr         run agents that keep going after you disconnect

  Unless you set a timeout, it pauses about 10 minutes after the last ssh
  session ends, and its files stay. To keep it running, run
  `polli sandbox timeout <id> 0` on your computer, or set it on the dashboard.

  Docs: https://gen.pollinations.ai/docs#tag/sandboxes

